    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d356">

                <pb facs="0313" n="303" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg303"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.01/5–1149: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-05-11">May 11,
                        1949</date>.<lb/>[Received May 11—1:18 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>996. Nanking <hi rendition="#italic">Hsin Hua Jih Pao</hi> May 10 carries
                    exclusive announcement of formation of new Nanking municipal government. Chinese
                    People’s Revolutionary Military Council appointed Liu Po-cheng as Mayor, Ko
                    Ching-shih and Chang Lin-chih as Deputy Mayors.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 996; repeated Shanghai 554, Peiping 153, Embassy Canton 396.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stuart</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
